    <p>The paper should be original and not published in other conferences or journals;</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>The paper format should conform to the conference submission template;</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>The paper should be no more than 10 pages in length (excluding references, but including appendices);</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Please submit through the official submission system.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>The review process will be double-blind. Authors must remove their names and affiliations from their submissions.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

